과 명의 대립으로 혼란은 극에 달하고, 청나라 황족 구루타이는 무리한 요구를 해대며 조선을 핍박한다. 백성들의 고통이 날로 더해가던 중, 구루타이의 수하들에 의해 태율의 딸이 공녀로 잡혀가고 만다. 세상을 등진 채 조용히 살고자 했던 조선 최고의 검객 태율은 딸을 구하기 위한 자비 없는 검을 휘두르기 시작하는데...","tagline":"끝까지 추격한다"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4hK3JtTw2KqEMOQURAJAzCrtl9t.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/5lmhjGvg5ddXbTXzeNJfU4qpIeh.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}},"tmdb:inventory-v2:series":{"originalLanguage":"ko-KR","images":{"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/r08U3dwiOeStXcjYmfnRyumgKyq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/r08U3dwiOeStXcjYmfnRyumgKyq.jpg","language":"en","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4hK3JtTw2KqEMOQURAJAzCrtl9t.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4hK3JtTw2KqEMOQURAJAzCrtl9t.jpg","language":"ko","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fQvB82yWE6xT07j9Iy0dX4SX31C.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/fQvB82yWE6xT07j9Iy0dX4SX31C.jpg","language":"ko","width":1899,"height":2848},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8ZQJYmxd6xER824P2T4QEq9ioqq.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/8ZQJYmxd6xER824P2T4QEq9ioqq.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kTAHuZmxRP9or3x35RIt2qQhLd9.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kTAHuZmxRP9or3x35RIt2qQhLd9.jpg","language":"en","width":812,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cpthM8fEZoPGRcROtEJnOZGXEvY.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cpthM8fEZoPGRcROtEJnOZGXEvY.jpg","language":"ko","width":1000,"height":1429},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/6FE7JTwsdUUge8y2Tsb4XcHorzL.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/6FE7JTwsdUUge8y2Tsb4XcHorzL.jpg","language":"ko","